1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,890
If you blocked this one protein,

2
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:04,050
your muscles could grow WAY bigger.

3
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:05,300
It's called myostatin,

4
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:07,390
and it acts like a brake on muscle growth.

5
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:09,750
But some animals are born without that brake.

6
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:12,480
And their muscles grow freakishly huge.

7
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,245
Scientists are even developing drugs

8
00:00:14,285 --> 00:00:15,880
that block it in humans.

9
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,670
But here's the weird part.

10
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:19,960
Bigger muscles don't always mean more strength.

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,170
So you could end up looking superhuman

12
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:24,380
without actually being super strong.

